* 3D drop solver: workpiece 2 lifted 3 between the dies (die 1 lifted 10) and dropped along +x. No ray from the workpiece nodes hits a die and no reverse ray from the die nodes hits the workpiece, so the solver stops with status 0 and no motion. Expect 'Object 2 has been dropped successfully.' and object 2 unchanged after the lift
KFREAD 0
UPSET_Brick.KEY
OBJPOS 1 1 0 0 10
OBJPOS 2 1 0 0 3
OBJPOS 2 7 0.002 1 0 0 0 0 0 0
KFWRIT
OUT.KEY
